(7642289, 1241131, 38032, '<td valign="top">I really appreciate this so much. Bummer that I didn''t vote =(<br/> <br/>The bird formation; the color; the simplicity combined with the somewhat bleak, rigid urban composition. It''s a true "this is life" image where we see everything is man-made, cold, and yet somehow temporary - and we reach out for life, nature, beauty and the peace of other life-forms to make us a part of something that has some sort of meaning - perhaps the hand presents a small gift representing love, perhaps an apology for humanity - perhaps just a symbol of loneliness, as your title hints at.<br/> <br/>Definitely a beauty and a big favorite.</td>', 'I really appreciate this so much. Bummer that I didn''t vote =( The bird formation; the color; the simplicity combined with the somewhat bleak, rigid urban composition. It''s a true "this is life" image where we see everything is man-made, cold, and yet somehow temporary - and we reach out for life, nature, beauty and the peace of other life-forms to make us a part of something that has some sort of meaning - perhaps the hand presents a small gift representing love, perhaps an apology for humanity - perhaps just a symbol of loneliness, as your title hints at. Definitely a beauty and a big favorite.', '2019-09-25 10:59:00.000000', NULL, 0),
