(7642322, 1241131, 97225, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo, Wendy, beautifully composed. From a design point of view, I like the way the birds, for the most part, occupy their own panel, but importantly for the story aspect, they encroach upon ''the neighbourhood'' and interact with the woman. Congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'Lovely photo, Wendy, beautifully composed. From a design point of view, I like the way the birds, for the most part, occupy their own panel, but importantly for the story aspect, they encroach upon ''the neighbourhood'' and interact with the woman. Congrats on the ribbon.', '2019-09-25 23:16:53.000000', NULL, 0),
