(7642339, 1240894, 6804, '<td valign="top">Morrisville,  a fine neighborhood indeed!  I think Black/White is a great choice for this.  Very clean!  Congrats on the honorable 4th place spot.</td>', 'Morrisville,  a fine neighborhood indeed!  I think Black/White is a great choice for this.  Very clean!  Congrats on the honorable 4th place spot.', '2019-09-26 02:21:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(7642347, 1241151, 163081, '<td valign="top">My neighborhood IS a business/shopping/residence area, in fact, whole Taipei is like that. The picture is taken at 200m from my home. So yes, it is my neighborhood.  There is no clear separation of districts in Taipei. It''s one big city. <br/></td>', 'My neighborhood IS a business/shopping/residence area, in fact, whole Taipei is like that. The picture is taken at 200m from my home. So yes, it is my neighborhood.  There is no clear separation of districts in Taipei. It''s one big city. ', '2019-09-26 11:17:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(7642487, 1241151, 67145, '<td valign="top">many congratulations on the blue for this amazing image .. <br/>it blows my mind the knowledge you must have to take this shot .. <br/>people arent blurring .. so you wouldnt be using a very slow shutter speed .. the car in the foreground might have been moving quite quickly .. ?? .. so the rest of your settings .. wide open aperture .. then i balk at the iso you would have to be using .. <br/>i would love to know how you got this .. just fantastic .. and brilliant .. <br/>its not just that you have great technique .. but the image itself is eye candy .. wonderful in black and white .. great contrast .. love the structure too .. :)</td>', 'many congratulations on the blue for this amazing image .. it blows my mind the knowledge you must have to take this shot .. people arent blurring .. so you wouldnt be using a very slow shutter speed .. the car in the foreground might have been moving quite quickly .. ?? .. so the rest of your settings .. wide open aperture .. then i balk at the iso you would have to be using .. i would love to know how you got this .. just fantastic .. and brilliant .. its not just that you have great technique .. but the image itself is eye candy .. wonderful in black and white .. great contrast .. love the structure too .. :)', '2019-09-28 09:40:15.000000', NULL, 0),
